#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime v0.40 or later (`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`)\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Runtime v0.40 أو أحدث (`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`)\n"

